25
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,264
Diaspore turns into delta-AlOOH, a
possible deep-Earth water carrier.

26
00:02:00,284 --> 00:02:05,165
The measured boundary near 18 gigapascal
is at high temperature.

27
00:02:05,185 --> 00:02:10,984
Our 300 kelvin models put it at 9 to 14
gigapascal, and both say deuteration

28
00:02:11,004 --> 00:02:16,881
raises it, by 1.13 and 1.33 gigapascal.
It is an exploratory sign prediction,

29
00:02:16,901 --> 00:02:22,930
because delta-AlOOH has proton disorder
there that harmonic physics leaves out.

30
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:29,566
Nobody has measured this directly, but the
isotope shift of a phase boundary equals

31
00:02:29,586 --> 00:02:35,835
the D/H fractionation between the two
phases, so deuterium partitioning between

32
00:02:35,855 --> 00:02:38,930
coexisting polymorphs is a direct test.

33
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:44,879
An AI team ran the work.
Literature agents on Valency Bond pulled

34
00:02:44,899 --> 00:02:48,781
