query.

35
00:02:48,801 --> 00:02:54,226
Predictions were committed to git before
the data were read.

36
00:02:54,246 --> 00:03:00,942
Councils of three models argued each
claim, and every decision records its

37
00:03:00,962 --> 00:03:05,207
