each measured value.

41
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,195
Limits.
One blind test came out mixed.

42
00:03:24,215 --> 00:03:28,509
The physics is harmonic, with no proton
tunnelling.

43
00:03:28,529 --> 00:03:34,854
The potentials are trained on similar
data, so three models agreeing is not

44
00:03:34,874 --> 00:03:39,930
